        <mxCell id="note" value="&lt;b&gt;System Boundary Notes&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• RRMS is the centralized system of record for internal business operations.&lt;br&gt;• Supplier and rider interactions are initially recorded manually by authorized users.&lt;br&gt;• WhatsApp remains external in V1; there is no direct WhatsApp Business API integration.&lt;br&gt;• Customer-facing storefront functionality belongs to the long-term RRMS product boundary but is not mandatory for V1." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#fff2cc;strokeColor=#d6b656;fontSize=14;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=12;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="120" y="850" width="1360" height="120" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
